on_edges(H))\n            if non_edges:\n                e = random.choice(non_edges)\n                H.add_edge(*e)\n        \n        rad = nx.radius(H)\n        gR = roman_domination_number(H)\n        diff = (rad + 1) - gR\n        if diff > 0:\n            print(f'COUNTEREXAMPLE FOUND! n={n}, rad={rad}, gR={gR}, edges={list(H.edges())}')\n            exit(0)\n        if diff >= best_diff:\n            best_diff = diff\n            G = H\n\nprint('No counterexample found via local search.')\n\"\nTask logs are available at: file:///tmp/agyhome.NWyWnj/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/fd5b67fc-d6c4-4d14-82ca-e67d7a968d5b/.system_generated/tasks/task-170.log\nYOU MUST TAKE ONE OF THE FOLLOWING TWO ACTIONS: A) either proceed to other relevant work (if any) or, B) simply update the user with a short message (that you have launched the command and will wait for it to finish) and end the turn.\n DO NOTHING ELSE."}
